// No decorator works on a class.
//
// A class's members take decorators, @public and a type such as @int, but the
// class itself takes none: not a function, a type or another class. The
// parser refuses it where it is written.
//
// This file is a fixture: `jade check` must REJECT it.

fn log(v) {
    return v
}

@log
class Account {
    @public balance
}
